# Stack specifics
• Framework: Next.js 15, App Router.
• Components live in /src/components; pages in /app.
• Use @/ alias for imports.

# CSS
• Prefer Tailwind utility classes; keep global CSS minimal.

# Accessibility
• All interactive elements must include focus styles and aria-labels.

# Commit policy
• Use Conventional Commits (feat, fix, chore, docs, etc.).
